post.description:
Use this API to create a product in Anchanto WMS. To call this API, users need to provide authorization token and other necessary details and specifications for a product, such as its name, SKU, description, and attributes.

      ### 📋 Request Template (Copy & Paste)
      ```json
      {
        "product": {
          "sku": "PROD-001",
          "name": "Test Product",
          "storage_type": "standard",
          "base_uom_code": "PCS",
          "product_type": "product",
          "product_sales_informations_attributes": [
            {
              "currency_code": "USD",
              "cost_price": 10.0,
              "selling_price": 15.0,
              "retail_price": 20.0
            }
          ],
          "product_dimensions_attributes": [
            {
              "length_cm": 10,
              "width_cm": 10,
              "height_cm": 10,
              "weight_gm": 100,
              "no_of_units": 1,
              "uom_code": "PCS"
            }
          ],
          "product_localizations_attributes": [
            {
              "country_iso": "US",
              "name": "Test Product US",
              "mark_as_default": true
            }
          ]
        }
      }
      ```

