Use this API to update a B2C Order in Anchanto WMS.

      ### 📋 Request Templates (Copy & Paste)

      #### 1. Add New Item
      ```json
      {
        "b2c_order": {
          "order_items_attributes": [
            {
              "sku": "SKU_NEW",
              "quantity": 2,
              "unit_price": 150,
              "item_udfs_attributes": {
                "Color": "Red",
                "Size": "Large",
                "Material": "Cotton",
                "Style": "Casual",
                "Pattern": "Striped",
                "Design": "Flowers",
                "Embroidery": "Yes"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
      ```

      #### 2. Update Existing Item Quantity
      ```json
      {
        "b2c_order": {
          "order_items_attributes": [
            {
              "line_number": 1,
              "sku": "SKU_EXISTING",
              "quantity": 5,
              "item_udfs_attributes": {
                "Color": "Blue",
                "Size": "Medium",
                "Material": "Polyester",
                "Style": "Casual",
                "Pattern": "Solid",
                "Design": "Flowers",
                "Embroidery": "Yes"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
      ```

      #### 3. Delete Item
      ```json
      {
        "b2c_order": {
          "order_items_attributes": [
            {
              "line_number": 2,
              "sku": "SKU_TO_DELETE",
              "delete_item": true
            }
          ]
        }
      }
      ```

      #### 4. Update Shipping Address
      ```json
      {
        "b2c_order": {
          "shipping_address_attributes": {
            "first_name": "Jane",
            "last_name": "Doe",
            "address1": "456 New St",
            "city": "New City",
            "zipcode": "67890",
            "country_iso": "US",
            "phone": "0987654321"
          }
        }
      }
      ```

      #### 5. Update with VAS (Value Added Services)
      ```json
      {
        "b2c_order": {
          "order_vas": ["Gift Wrapping"],
          "order_gift_message": "Happy Birthday!",
          "order_items_attributes": [
            {
              "line_number": 1,
              "sku": "SKU123",
              "quantity": 2,
              "sku_vas": ["Engraving"],
              "sku_gift_message": "To Mom",
              "sku_etching_message": "Name: John"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
      ```

      ### 🔧 VAS (Value Added Services) Parameters
      > **Prerequisite:** The tenant setting `vas_enabled` must be turned ON. If disabled, VAS parameters are silently ignored.

      | Parameter | Level | Type | Description |
      |-----------|-------|------|-------------|
      | `order_vas` | Order | Array/String | VAS codes or names at order level. **Replaces** existing VAS on update. Send blank to clear. |
      | `order_gift_message` | Order | String | Gift message for order-level Gift Message VAS |
      | `sku_vas` | Item | Array/String | VAS codes or names at item level. **Replaces** existing VAS on update. |
      | `sku_gift_message` | Item | String | Gift message for item-level Gift Message VAS |
      | `sku_etching_message` | Item | String | Etching/engraving message for item-level Etching VAS |

      **Note:** When order is `in_progress`, `order_items_attributes` is blocked — item-level VAS cannot be updated.

      👉 IMPORTANT:
      - Use `line_number` to target specific items for update or deletion.
      - To delete an item, set `delete_item: true` along with its `line_number`.
      - New items are added if no `line_number` is provided.

