Use this API to create flow through order in Anchanto WMS. Flow-through orders are designed for quick processing and direct fulfillment without the need for extensive warehousing operations.

      ### 📋 Request Templates (Copy & Paste)

      #### 1. Flow Through Order
      ```json
      {
        "sales_order": {
          "shipping_type": "standard_delivery",
          "payment_collection_name": "online",
          "currency_code": "USD",
          "carrier": {
            "carrier_code": "DHL",
            "carrier_name": "DHL Express"
          },
          "order_items_attributes": [
            {
              "sku": "SKU123",
              "quantity": 10,
              "unit_price": 50.0,
              "item_udfs_attributes": {
                "Color": "Red",
                "Size": "Large",
                "Material": "Cotton",
                "Style": "Casual",
                "Pattern": "Striped",
                "Design": "Flowers",
                "Embroidery": "Yes"
              }
            }
          ],
          "billing_address_attributes": {
            "first_name": "John",
            "city": "New York",
            "country_iso": "US",
            "phone": "1234567890"
          },
          "shipping_address_attributes": {
            "first_name": "John",
            "city": "New York",
            "country_iso": "US",
            "phone": "1234567890"
          }
        },
        "purchase_order": {
          "pos": [
            {
              "supplier_id": 1,
              "receiving_date": "2023-12-31",
              "consignment_items_attributes": [
                {
                  "sku": "SKU123",
                  "quantity": 10,
                  "unit_price": 40.0
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
      ```

      #### 2. Flow Through Order with VAS
      ```json
      {
        "sales_order": {
          "shipping_type": "standard_delivery",
          "payment_collection_name": "online",
          "currency_code": "USD",
          "order_vas": ["Quality Check"],
          "carrier": { "carrier_code": "DHL", "carrier_name": "DHL Express" },
          "order_items_attributes": [
            {
              "sku": "SKU123",
              "quantity": 10,
              "sku_vas": ["Labeling"]
            }
          ],
          "billing_address_attributes": { ... },
          "shipping_address_attributes": { ... }
        },
        "purchase_order": { ... }
      }
      ```

      ### 🔧 VAS (Value Added Services) Parameters
      > **Prerequisite:** The tenant setting `vas_enabled` must be ON. If disabled, VAS parameters are silently ignored.

      | Parameter | Level | Type | Description |
      |-----------|-------|------|-------------|
      | `order_vas` | Order | Array/String | VAS codes or names at order level |
      | `sku_vas` | Item | Array/String | VAS codes or names at item level |

      **Note:** Flow-through orders do **NOT** support `order_gift_message`, `sku_gift_message`, or `sku_etching_message`.

