Fires when a B2C pick pool moves to **`picked`**. Only sent if the tenant has **B2C pick-pool flow** enabled and the webhook is activated.

### 📋 Sample payload (Copy & Paste)

#### Standard pick-pool-after-picked webhook
**`pick_bins`** is an array of **pick bin code strings** (distinct codes from the bins used for picking). **`secret_key`** may be an empty string in live payloads; it is omitted here to match the schema below.

```json
{
  "event_parameters": {
    "warehouse_code": "WH01",
    "seller_email": "seller@example.com",
    "api_key": "your-api-key"
  },
  "event": {
    "pick_pool_data": [
      {
        "order_number": "ORD-778899",
        "pick_pool_number": "PP-20260507143052",
        "company_code": "CUST001",
        "pick_bins": ["BIN-01", "BIN-02"]
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

**Note:** Swagger types **`pick_bins`** as objects; live payloads use **strings**.

