Use this API to create STO Orders in the Anchanto WMS.

<b>Copy & Paste the JSON below in the Request Body:</b>
<pre>
{
  "b2b_order": {
    "number": "STO-ORDER-001",
    "to_warehouse_code": "WH-002",
    "is_stock_transfer": true,
    "carrier": {
      "carrier_code": "DHL",
      "carrier_name": "DHL Express"
    },
    "order_items_attributes": [
      {
        "sku": "PROD001",
        "quantity": 10
      }
    ]
  }
}
</pre>

<b>STO Order with VAS:</b>
<pre>
{
  "b2b_order": {
    "to_warehouse_code": "WH-002",
    "is_stock_transfer": true,
    "order_vas": ["Quality Check", "Labeling"],
    "carrier": { "carrier_code": "DHL", "carrier_name": "DHL Express" },
    "order_items_attributes": [
      {
        "sku": "PROD001",
        "quantity": 10,
        "sku_vas": ["Repackaging"]
      }
    ]
  }
}
</pre>

<b>VAS (Value Added Services) Parameters:</b>
Prerequisite: The tenant setting <code>vas_enabled</code> must be ON. If disabled, VAS parameters are silently ignored.
<ul>
  <li><code>order_vas</code> - VAS codes/names at order level. Array or comma-separated string.</li>
  <li><code>sku_vas</code> - VAS codes/names at item level (inside order_items_attributes).</li>
</ul>
<b>Note:</b> STO orders do NOT support <code>order_gift_message</code>, <code>sku_gift_message</code>, or <code>sku_etching_message</code>.

